Z||000012||Songman||01-10-2001||01:25 AM||||I'm with you, Robert! Everywhere I turn I keep hearing how great it is to see all the Fieros at Daytona! I have been there for the Harley runs, I have been there for the rod shows! Can't wait to see all the Fieros all over the place down there! I'm hoping to have my Pace Car all painted and shined and ready to go! And don't you worry, you are always welcome with the Tennessee bunch!<P>And I hope to be seeing you plenty in Florida on my trips to Jacksonville too! I'm there at least every other month!<P>For my count now that is 13 of us in TN! Hope we'll get more as we go along too! I am going to print up some cards with the TN logo that I made and put out on cars that I see. I am waiting on @Home to authorize the site so I can upload it. I'll post the URL as soon as it is active.<P>Thanks everybody!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> ||||reg||14
Z||000013||Songman||01-10-2001||02:14 AM||||Okay, the website is up. There really isn't much there yet but an invitation for people to get more info. There are a couple of cars and graphics that I 'borrowed' from people here until I can get some more done. I appreaciate it and hope you don't mind. Oreif, your painted door emblem makes a nice graphic for a page!<P>Everyone is invited to take a look-see and let me know what you think. Now I have to figure out what else to put on there!<P>See it here:<BR>  <A HREF="http://drive.to/TNFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://drive.to/TNFieros</A>      -or-<BR>  <A HREF="http://homepages.go.com/~tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>http://homepages.go.com/~tnfieros</A>  <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 01-10-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000014||Songman||01-11-2001||01:02 PM||||Looking for pics and info of any Tennessee Fiero to go on the webpage. Surrounding areas are welcome too. Anyone that would be willing to drive to meet with us...<P>Also, links to any TN Fiero owners web page. I'll also build a separate page of links for other than TN owners. Please e-mail me if you would like to have your site listed. If you just want a text link, I will include it. If you have a banner you would like used, please send me the code...<P>Please send e-mail for this to tnfieros@home.com. That way I can keep it separate from my other mail and it won't get lost.<P>We stand at 14 right now and are trying to figure out when and where we can have a first get-together...<P>--------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/tnfieros/TNFiero.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 01-11-2001).]||||reg||1
